@startuml C1_VVE_Execution_Context
title C1 – VVE Execution Update Scenario

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "PLMS Portal" {
  package "Angular SPA" as Spa
}
rectangle "PLMS Backend" as Backend
rectangle "OEM Platform" as Oem
rectangle "Identity Provider" as Idp
rectangle "Operation Plan Service" as PlanService

Operator --> Spa : Record executed operations
Spa --> Backend : HTTPS (Update VVE operations)
Backend --> Oem : Forward bulk execution updates
Oem --> PlanService : Sync status/deltas
Oem --> Backend : Execution update response
Backend --> Spa : JSON with progress & warnings
Spa --> Operator : Show progress + variances
Spa --> Idp : OIDC session
Backend --> Idp : Token validation

@enduml
